  "configuration_id": "config_032",
  "reason": "The evidence strongly identifies scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + multiprofile as the dominant design (0.706–0.725 accuracy vs ≤0.54 for all other encoder pairs). Within this cell, transformer+weighted (config_031, 0.725) and transformer+concat (config_048, 0.721) and avgpool+weighted (config_019, 0.706) have been tested. config_032 (avgpool+concat) is the only remaining untested aggregation×fusion combination for this proven encoder pair. While it is unlikely to surpass 0.725, it completes the 2×2 matrix, rules out any surprising interaction between avgpool and concat, and provides the final data point needed to confirm the ranking before the last experiment. Expected relative cost: moderate (~4–5 GPU hours), comparable to other avgpool-based multimodal multiprofile runs (config_019: 4.82, config_005: 4.33), and cheaper than the transformer-based configs in this family."
}

